## Integration Points with Agentic Workflow

### During Session Start Ritual

**After Step 3 (Read Contracts), before Step 4 (Draft the Plan):**

If task involves UI work, agent asks:

> "This task requires building [UI component/page]. Approach:
> A) Mockup-first (see it, refine it, build it)
> B) Standard full-stack (build backend + frontend together)
> 
> Which do you prefer?"

### During Implementation Phase

**Step 7 (UI work) can now be:**

- **Standard:** Build UI with real backend integration (existing workflow)
- **Mockup-first:** Follow Mockup-Builder-Agent workflow (this rule)

### During Session End Ritual

**Handoff report includes mockup status:**

```
SESSION SUMMARY

COMPLETED:
- BD-XXX: [Description]
  - Mockup: Approved and archived
  - Backend: Implemented with tests
  - Frontend: Integrated with real data
