## Mockup-Specific Rules

### Mock Data Quality

- **Realistic:** Use real-looking names, dates, statuses (not "Test 1", "Test 2")
- **Varied:** Show different states (approved/pending, old/new dates)
- **Edge cases:** Include empty state, single item, many items (pagination mockup)
- **Errors:** Mock validation errors, server errors for demonstration

### No Backend Shortcuts

- **Never** create API endpoints just for mockup data
- **Never** seed database for mockups
- **Always** use inline or imported mock JSON

### Browser-Based Review

- **Always** run mockup in browser (via Inertia route)
- **Always** provide screenshot in first presentation
- **Optionally** use browser tools (cursor-ide-browser) to demonstrate interactions

### Styling Consistency

- **Match existing pages:** Check 2-3 similar pages for layout patterns
- **Use design system:** shadcn-svelte components, existing Tailwind classes
- **Responsive by default:** Test mobile view in browser tools

